flowchart TB
accTitle: Environment gates the patch rollout
accDescr: Development and test have separate baseline associations and receive installation now; production remains held until testing succeeds.
D[Development group] --> DB[Development baseline]
T[Test group] --> TB[Test baseline]
P[Production group] --> PB[Production baseline]
DB --> I[Install in development and test]
TB --> I
I --> C{Application tests pass?}
C -->|No| H[Hold production]
C -->|Yes| A[Approve and target production]
PB --> A
A --> PI[Production installation]
